\pard\b\fs20 Story of Harkon\b0\par
\fs16\par
An epic story of young Harkon, who is trained to be an assassin.\par
\par
Sneak through castles, pick locks, assassinate guards, steal money!\par
\par
It is designed above all for one player. Several players can also try to master the missions together, though some of the missions are then a little easier.\par
